c6f7-099e-4601-872d-71621bb803e5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=85c64c18b5b09c1f5d4b8caa7b62bea3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、先生！先生の描くキャラクターは本当に大好きです。私のオリジナルキャラクターを描いていただけませんか？\n\n30歳から35歳。この人は元々皇族の方で、ゆるふわで上品なタイプです。細身で（だから筋肉はあまりない）中性的な外見をしています。\n\n鎖で首輪を縛られ、顔や体に殴られた跡があり、誰かが鎖を引っ張っています。髪が乱れていたり、服装が乱れていたり、セクシーな感じでお願いします。><\n\nこの依頼に不適切な点があると思われる場合は、遠慮なくキャンセルしてください、ありがとうございました!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1I80lfqA-CoLgl4oRIFvqGfJiUcKT94Lz?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@senbeikun_/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/14982d1a/uploads/origins/7be982bd-ae8a-4ae4-bb75-cd6d46c45f59?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=90922ce61dd2f11ea372ee3993a2742d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/14982d1a/uploads/origins/7be982bd-ae8a-4ae4-bb75-cd6d46c45f59?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=90922ce61dd2f11ea372ee3993a2742d, https://si.imgix.net/14982d1a/uploads/origins/7be982bd-ae8a-4ae4-bb75-cd6d46c45f59?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1cfe18d05e4f1621e7512b40d6423ea2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/14982d1a/uploads/origins/7be982bd-ae8a-4ae4-bb75-cd6d46c45f59?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=47ee088111aba348921949b2a8cc6c70 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello. I am looking to get art done of my OC. My OC is an okami who is mostly out at night hiding in the dark. I want a pose of her crying hard, as if she is finally letting out all her emotions at once. I want it to be as depressing but epic as possible. I have a few references that you can go by. I was thinking that you can make it where at least one hand is covering her face, as if she is in pain, and the rest of the face you can see full of tears running down. Feel free to add background and rain freely if this will add a nice touch to it. You also have the freedom to add anything else additonal. Thank you so much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Qbfor0OFNB9ijGo2ZnksFiNTetyvi1yY?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@senbeikun_/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f26103e8/uploads/origins/97b8c954-be69-4534-acc0-aace2c88106b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=252f2a3585450060d7f99d0fc6698c2b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f26103e8/uploads/origins/97b8c954-be69-4534-acc0-aace2c88106b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=252f2a3585450060d7f99d0fc6698c2b, https://si.imgix.net/f26103e8/uploads/origins/97b8c954-be69-4534-acc0-aace2c88106b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=01f164258cdeea1c9005e5e180cda359 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f26103e8/uploads/origins/97b8c954-be69-4534-acc0-aace2c88106b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=793aa42c43c958929aff4744956a4ca8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "これは物語のバッドエンドで、最初に描いてくれた絵の数日前の出来事で、日晴が夫を撃って泣くというものです。\n\n初夜なんです。日晴は結婚したのですが、ヤクザの旦那に触られた時に男だとバレて、死ぬ寸前まで殴られるんです。\n\nウエディングドレスを着た日晴は、顔や体中にあざができ、血を流しているところを描いてほしいです。ドレスは破れ、体からぶら下がっています。日晴の表情は絶望的です。偶然にもその男に恋をしてしまったのですが、そのヤクザ男はノンケで女しか好みません。\n親を亡くし、社会から弾き出され、失意のどん底にいる。\n\nこれがそのドレスです。このように、「萌え萌え」なのです。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1mlWr5x3svbkUFszOoOOtKSPf0D1y_zbW?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1rOYlbQigFTXFinl9Z6JO4Wfg_Wbtfaqn?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@senbeikun_/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b72b1cfd/uploads/origins/380c77ae-8c27-4175-abc6-ab97f05e408d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb4087c07c8b68478f1e955bfc4ebf17", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b72b1cfd/uploads/origins/380c77ae-8c27-4175-abc6-ab97f05e408d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb4087c07c8b68478f1e955bfc4ebf17, https://si.imgix.net/b72b1cfd/uploads/origins/380c77ae-8c27-4175-abc6-ab97f05e408d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6a8b2b4e683db1c68283fcccadceebd9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b72b1cfd/uploads/origins/380c77ae-8c27-4175-abc6-ab97f05e408d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc058270a84dec3c0692fc9bbae9069e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi, I would like artwork of my Vtuber. My character is a big sister otokonoko (男の娘). He is a ex-wife to a yakuza. He tried to kill his yakuza husband, after his husband found out he was a man. He has a very cool and sexy vibe.\n\nPlease draw my character crying next to his husband. The yakuza husband is laying down with gunshot wounds. They just got into a physical fight so feel free to draw bruises or injuries on both people.\n\nThank you!\n\nReference link included below.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1rOYlbQigFTXFinl9Z6JO4Wfg_Wbtfaqn?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}